==========================================================================================================
1. Configure general configurations on all devices. All passwords must be 'cisco' and must be encrypted.


@R1
---
conf t
hostname R1
enable secret cisco
service password-encryption
no ip domain-lookup
!
line vty 0 4
password cisco
login
exec-timeout 0 0
logging synchronous
exit
!
line con 0
password cisco
login
exec-timeout 0 0
logging synchronous
exit
!
banner login &
====================
      ** R1 **
==================== &
exit


